## **VIII. INFERENCE SZERVER ÉS API**

### **1. API/Inference_Server.zig - Production-Ready HTTP Server**

Ez egy **teljes körű inference API** biztonsági funkciókkal.

**Főbb Komponensek:**

#### **a) Rate Limiting**

```zig
const RateLimiter = struct {
    logs: std.StringHashMap(RequestLog),
    mutex: Thread.Mutex,
    window_seconds: u64,
    max_requests: u32,

    const RequestLog = struct {
        timestamps: std.ArrayList(i64),
        mutex: Thread.Mutex,
    };

    pub fn checkAndRecord(self: *RateLimiter, ip_address: []const u8) !bool {
        const now = std.time.timestamp();
        const cutoff = now - @as(i64, @intCast(self.window_seconds));

        self.mutex.lock();
        defer self.mutex.unlock();

        var entry = try self.logs.getOrPut(ip_address);
        if (!entry.found_existing) {
            entry.value_ptr.* = RequestLog{
                .timestamps = std.ArrayList(i64).init(self.allocator),
                .mutex = Thread.Mutex{},
            };
        }

        var log = entry.value_ptr;
        log.mutex.lock();
        defer log.mutex.unlock();

        // Remove old timestamps
        var i: usize = 0;
        while (i < log.timestamps.items.len) {
            if (log.timestamps.items[i] < cutoff) {
                _ = log.timestamps.orderedRemove(i);
            } else {
                i += 1;
            }
        }

        // Check limit
        if (log.timestamps.items.len >= self.max_requests) {
            return false;  // Rate limit exceeded
        }

        try log.timestamps.append(now);
        return true;
    }
};
```

**Védelem:**
- **Sliding window** (pontosabb mint fixed window)
- **Per-IP tracking**
- **Thread-safe** (concurrent requests)

#### **b) API Key Authentication**

```zig
fn checkAuthorization(
    self: *InferenceServer,
    headers: []const u8,
    expected_key: []const u8
) bool {
    var lines = mem.splitSequence(u8, headers, "\\r\\n");
    while (lines.next()) |line| {
        if (mem.startsWith(u8, line, "Authorization:")) {
            const value_start = mem.indexOf(u8, line, ":") orelse continue;
            const value = mem.trim(u8, line[value_start + 1 ..], " \\t");

            if (mem.startsWith(u8, value, "Bearer ")) {
                const token = mem.trim(u8, value[7..], " \\t");
                return mem.eql(u8, token, expected_key);
            }
        }
    }
    return false;
}
```

